    "created_at": "2022-04-05T12:16:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-04-05T12:16:04Z",
    "body": "I mean, I agree with that idea, but I just want to point out a couple of things:\r\n - I don't have a Twitter account. Or more precisely, I do have it, but do not use it. Although if the announcement is going to be made, I will of course get my account up to date.\r\n - *(dense explanation ahead: )* While it's great the idea about getting this initiative more visible, in my eyes this is just another translation project. For sure, this is by far the biggest one since I'm also planning for translating the other WHATWG documents. I completely understand the excitement due to what I have declared, and to be honest, as I said, I'm also very excited to what is to come with this localisation project. Nonetheless, I don't consider this project (my localisation one, I mean) to have enough weight to be shared in one of the WHATWG accounts, accounts which, for me, they are a really big of a deal, since these are accounts of the team that manages web-related specs (ie all foundations on which any webpage is build upon), and, just, I don't think this humble work I'm doing should have that *much* relevance. Perhaps I'm just feeling modest because I'm doing this out of passion. But to sum up and be clear, I won't say I don't want this to be shared if this announcement is proposed to me, I just don't feel it's *that* a big of a deal. Sure, I mean, this is a really important document and it's going to be localised; but I'm just doubting about doing the announcement at least for now, and I'm more thinking about announcing this when I'm finished, because with no exaggeration I can surely say this project most probably will take more than a year to be finished. On the other hand, if you and the rest of the \"executive\"/decision-making team of WHATWG consider this matter to be as big of a news that you want to post it in one of the WHATWG accounts, well, I would be very excited to be appearing in a Tweet of such account, albeit what I've done so far is to declare my intention and plan myself. But I repeat, if you consider this news has enough weight, then go for it; I don't mind. :)\r\nAlso, to clarify, by \"announcement\" I mean retweeting my Tweet; what you've just said.",
